# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Files & directories the Docker build context should NEVER include.
#
# Smaller context = faster builds + smaller images + fewer leaks.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Local development state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# ── Node / frontend ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# We build the frontend INSIDE the image (multi-stage), so host node_modules
# and existing dist/ are irrelevant — and copying them in would conflict
# with the build stage.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── Data files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The SQLite database is bind-mounted as a volume at runtime; it must NOT
# be baked into the image (would ship someone else's data + balloon size).
data/
backend/ktrade.db
*.db
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite

# ── Git ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo

# ── Claude Code / worktrees ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
.worktrees/

# ── CI / Docker meta ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.github/
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore

# ── Documentation that's not needed at runtime ──────────────────────────────
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
docs/
*.md
LICENSE

# ── Local launchers (not used inside the container) ─────────────────────────
start.sh
start.command
